<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Painewebber cuts Cisco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Painewebber cuts Cisco.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Paul Weinstein cut his rating on Cisco Systems Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- No details were immediately available on the downgrade.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
</text>
